; Mg. proton-12. period 3, group 2 alkaline earth. valence: 2.
; burns with intense white flame (used in flares, fireworks).
; essential in chlorophyll — the Mg ion at centre of the porphyrin ring.
; structural: lightweight alloys with aluminium. bone mineral alongside calcium.
; Mg²⁺ ion: cofactor for ATP hydrolysis, DNA replication enzymes.

